{
  "screen_id": "notification-settings",
  "route": "/s/notification-settings",
  "title": "通知設定",
  "layout": "standard",
  "notes": "V3-UIX-42 通知設定(g79-uib07impl2・設計正本=kits/lane-think/R0801-b391f1-REPORT-2026-08-01-g78-uib07think.md T3案1/T4 Ship2)。実在5系統(karma/platinum/dm/trade/system・uib07think T1-bの実測)に限定し『15種』は実装しない(内訳文書が実在しないため)。1キー4値enum(off/push/mail/push+mail・pref-set.schema.json)でカテゴリON/OFFとpush/mail送信可否を同時表現。DND2キー(dnd_start/dnd_end)は既定22:00-07:00(要件明示値)。既存の GET/PATCH /api/v1/me/preferences をそのまま使う(新規route0本・settings-routes.ts:22-23既存方針)。現在値はcard(source_path)+text 3本(interpolate対応)で表示(select系はrendererがdefaultValue事前選択に未対応=settings.jsonと同じ制約・T3見落とし節)。★誇張ゼロ契約: 実配信基盤(VAPID鍵・メール鍵)は人間ゲート(実鍵投入)につき未整備であることを画面に明記(notice)。CLUSTER_OWNEDに追加登録(check-screendef-structure.mjs)し構造/i18nゲートを両方有効化する判断(ゲート回避の抜け道を作らない・uib07think T3)。",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "shell",
      "type": "app-shell",
      "props": { "page_info": { "purpose": "通知の種類ごとに、プッシュ通知・メールを受け取るか・受け取らない時間帯(サイレント時間)を設定する画面。", "talk_channel": true } },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "page",
          "type": "page",
          "children": [
            { "id": "title", "type": "heading", "props": { "text_key": "notification-settings.title.text", "text": "通知設定", "level": 1 } },
            { "id": "notice", "type": "text", "props": { "text_key": "notification-settings.notice.text", "text": "ここで設定した内容は保存されますが、実際にプッシュ通知やメールを送る仕組み(配信基盤)は現時点でありません。設定してもすぐには送信されません。", "muted": true } },
            {
              "id": "current",
              "type": "card",
              "props": { "source_path": "/api/v1/me/preferences" },
              "children": [
                { "id": "current-cat-economy", "type": "text", "props": { "text_key": "notification-settings.current-cat-economy.text", "text": "現在: カルマ{{data.current.notify_karma}}・プラチナ投票{{data.current.notify_platinum}}", "muted": true } },
                { "id": "current-cat-comm", "type": "text", "props": { "text_key": "notification-settings.current-cat-comm.text", "text": "現在: DM{{data.current.notify_dm}}・取引{{data.current.notify_trade}}", "muted": true } },
                { "id": "current-cat-system", "type": "text", "props": { "text_key": "notification-settings.current-cat-system.text", "text": "現在: システム{{data.current.notify_system}}・サイレント時間帯{{data.current.dnd_start}}〜{{data.current.dnd_end}}(下のフォームで変更できます)", "muted": true } }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "notify-form",
              "type": "form",
              "action": { "kind": "api", "method": "PATCH", "path": "/api/v1/me/preferences", "body_from": "notify-form", "toast": "通知設定を保存しました" },
              "children": [
                { "id": "group-categories", "type": "heading", "props": { "text_key": "notification-settings.group-categories.text", "text": "カテゴリ別通知", "level": 2 } },
                { "id": "notify-karma", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "select", "name": "notify_karma", "label_key": "notification-settings.notify-karma.label", "label": "カルマ通知", "placeholder": "通知チャネルを選ぶ", "options": [
                  { "value": "off", "label": "オフ" },
                  { "value": "push", "label": "プッシュ" },
                  { "value": "mail", "label": "メール" },
                  { "value": "push+mail", "label": "プッシュ+メール" }
                ] } },
                { "id": "notify-platinum", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "select", "name": "notify_platinum", "label_key": "notification-settings.notify-platinum.label", "label": "プラチナ投票通知", "placeholder": "通知チャネルを選ぶ", "options": [
                  { "value": "off", "label": "オフ" },
                  { "value": "push", "label": "プッシュ" },
                  { "value": "mail", "label": "メール" },
                  { "value": "push+mail", "label": "プッシュ+メール" }
                ] } },
                { "id": "notify-dm", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "select", "name": "notify_dm", "label_key": "notification-settings.notify-dm.label", "label": "DM通知", "placeholder": "通知チャネルを選ぶ", "options": [
                  { "value": "off", "label": "オフ" },
                  { "value": "push", "label": "プッシュ" },
                  { "value": "mail", "label": "メール" },
                  { "value": "push+mail", "label": "プッシュ+メール" }
                ] } },
                { "id": "notify-trade", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "select", "name": "notify_trade", "label_key": "notification-settings.notify-trade.label", "label": "取引通知", "placeholder": "通知チャネルを選ぶ", "options": [
                  { "value": "off", "label": "オフ" },
                  { "value": "push", "label": "プッシュ" },
                  { "value": "mail", "label": "メール" },
                  { "value": "push+mail", "label": "プッシュ+メール" }
                ] } },
                { "id": "notify-system", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "select", "name": "notify_system", "label_key": "notification-settings.notify-system.label", "label": "システム通知", "placeholder": "通知チャネルを選ぶ", "options": [
                  { "value": "off", "label": "オフ" },
                  { "value": "push", "label": "プッシュ" },
                  { "value": "mail", "label": "メール" },
                  { "value": "push+mail", "label": "プッシュ+メール" }
                ] } },
                { "id": "group-dnd", "type": "heading", "props": { "text_key": "notification-settings.group-dnd.text", "text": "サイレント時間帯(DND)", "level": 2 } },
                { "id": "dnd-start", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "select", "name": "dnd_start", "label_key": "notification-settings.dnd-start.label", "label": "開始時刻(既定22:00)", "placeholder": "開始時刻を選ぶ", "options": [
                  { "value": "00:00", "label": "00:00" }, { "value": "01:00", "label": "01:00" }, { "value": "02:00", "label": "02:00" }, { "value": "03:00", "label": "03:00" },
                  { "value": "04:00", "label": "04:00" }, { "value": "05:00", "label": "05:00" }, { "value": "06:00", "label": "06:00" }, { "value": "07:00", "label": "07:00" },
                  { "value": "08:00", "label": "08:00" }, { "value": "09:00", "label": "09:00" }, { "value": "10:00", "label": "10:00" }, { "value": "11:00", "label": "11:00" },
                  { "value": "12:00", "label": "12:00" }, { "value": "13:00", "label": "13:00" }, { "value": "14:00", "label": "14:00" }, { "value": "15:00", "label": "15:00" },
                  { "value": "16:00", "label": "16:00" }, { "value": "17:00", "label": "17:00" }, { "value": "18:00", "label": "18:00" }, { "value": "19:00", "label": "19:00" },
                  { "value": "20:00", "label": "20:00" }, { "value": "21:00", "label": "21:00" }, { "value": "22:00", "label": "22:00" }, { "value": "23:00", "label": "23:00" }
                ] } },
                { "id": "dnd-end", "type": "field", "props": { "variant": "select", "name": "dnd_end", "label_key": "notification-settings.dnd-end.label", "label": "終了時刻(既定07:00)", "placeholder": "終了時刻を選ぶ", "options": [
                  { "value": "00:00", "label": "00:00" }, { "value": "01:00", "label": "01:00" }, { "value": "02:00", "label": "02:00" }, { "value": "03:00", "label": "03:00" },
                  { "value": "04:00", "label": "04:00" }, { "value": "05:00", "label": "05:00" }, { "value": "06:00", "label": "06:00" }, { "value": "07:00", "label": "07:00" },
                  { "value": "08:00", "label": "08:00" }, { "value": "09:00", "label": "09:00" }, { "value": "10:00", "label": "10:00" }, { "value": "11:00", "label": "11:00" },
                  { "value": "12:00", "label": "12:00" }, { "value": "13:00", "label": "13:00" }, { "value": "14:00", "label": "14:00" }, { "value": "15:00", "label": "15:00" },
                  { "value": "16:00", "label": "16:00" }, { "value": "17:00", "label": "17:00" }, { "value": "18:00", "label": "18:00" }, { "value": "19:00", "label": "19:00" },
                  { "value": "20:00", "label": "20:00" }, { "value": "21:00", "label": "21:00" }, { "value": "22:00", "label": "22:00" }, { "value": "23:00", "label": "23:00" }
                ] } },
                { "id": "save", "type": "button", "props": { "label_key": "notification-settings.save.label", "label": "設定を保存する", "variant": "primary", "type": "submit" } }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "next-step",
              "type": "link",
              "props": { "label_key": "notification-settings.next.label", "label": "設定に戻る", "href": "/s/settings", "next_step": "設定に戻る" }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "transitions": [
    { "from": "notify-form", "to_screen_id": "notification-settings", "label": "保存後に再読込" }
  ]
}
